  "summary": "<p>One year after President Donald J. Trump signed the Working Families Tax Cuts into law, a new report confirms the legislation has delivered a powerful manufacturing resurgence in every state. The landmark law has sustained nearly six million American jobs, preserved more than $1 trillion in economic output, and safeguarded $540 billion in wages — [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/president-trumps-working-families-tax-cuts-ignite-manufacturing-renaissance-across-all-50-states/\">President Trump’s Working Families Tax Cuts Ignite Manufacturing Renaissance Across All 50 States</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
